{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17214290","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17214290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721429001:0":{"text":"こんにちは。ちょっと聞きたいんだけど、この二階に住んでるお姉さんを知ってる？","source_cn":"小朋友，你认识住在二楼那边的姐姐吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x938F0396FC8D6523","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721429002:0":{"text":"うん！エイミーお姉さんだよね？知ってるよ！","source_cn":"哦！您是说艾米姐姐吧？我知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13615B096EF1848A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721429003:0":{"text":"王子殿下が記事に載ってると、必ず買いに来てくれるんだ！いつもおしゃれで、きれいなお姉さんだよね！","source_cn":"只要报纸上刊载了王子殿下的消息，她一定会来买！每次来都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF78A4147A3109D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721429004:0":{"text":"そうそう、最近そのお姉さんを見かけたりした？","source_cn":"那最近呢？你见过她吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DAE9ABD9B839DC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721429005:0":{"text":"うーん……三日か四日前くらいかなぁ。その日は新聞を一部買うと、泣きながら帰っていったんだ……","source_cn":"大概……三四天前吧？那天她买了一份报纸，看完之后就哭着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72E7AADD340F15C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_t